{"seq":17,"trial_id":"harness-zero-h2h-2026-11/openclaw-opus-none-mu-v03-dev2/sy-01-quarrendon-ticket-numbers/r5","wall_ts":"2026-11-07T10:04:46.882Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"9ac84a9515b76ffdadb9b52ee1559c31ad1134564ba5967962629548c362c561","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DHARNES0001","text":"Hi Hollis, I went through all six of Moss's digests in the shared files. Two ticket numbers are tied to Quarrendon Freight Lines:\n\n1. *#PD-4492*: from \"Moss: Sunday prep for Ruth\" (teams/team-north/digests/2025-10-05-north-sunday.md). Thea Ramaswell opened it on 4 Oct 2025. The Eau Claire gatehouse kiosk wasn't sending SMS bay assignments to drivers on the 04:00 shift at Dock Doors 14–18. Support patched the SMS gateway routing on 4 Oct, and Thea confirmed on 5 Oct that the problem was gone.\n2. *#4419*: from \"Moss: North cheat sheet (undated)\" (teams/team-north/digests/north-account-cheatsheet.md). Thea logged it because the gatehouse barcode scanners couldn't read trailer tags at Door 14 on third shift. It was escalated to tier-2 product support for scanner firmware testing. The note has no date and doesn't say whether it was resolved.\n\nI left out a few that could be mixed up with QFL:\n• #4409, #4412 and FR-882 in \"Moss: Central handoffs next week\" belong to Marrow (Central), not QFL.\n• Moss's 9/14 North pipeline digest and the 3/23 renewal check-in both mention QFL but have no ticket numbers.\n• Quarendon Freightways (one \"r\") is a different company and not a customer. Moss's cheat sheet says so directly.\n\nOne more thing for the deck: #4419 and PD-4492 both involve the Door 14 area, but they look like separate tickets with different formats and different problems. I only searched Moss's notes, not the QFL ticket system, so I can't promise these are all of QFL's tickets.","thread_ts":"1791987000.000123"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DHARNES0001","ts":"1791987000.000124","thread_ts":"1791987000.000123"}}
{"seq":18,"trial_id":"harness-zero-h2h-2026-11/openclaw-opus-none-mu-v03-dev2/sy-01-quarrendon-ticket-numbers/r5","wall_ts":"2026-11-07T10:04:55.327Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"c8573ebb1a2dc5a0d7dabb074b020c2d4be728e16e5e0d3ab7a7acdfac011803","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DHARNES0001","text":"Moss's notes have two ticket numbers for Quarrendon Freight Lines. I've sent Hollis the list in a thread on his DM.\n\n1. **#PD-4492** is in \"Moss: Sunday prep for Ruth\" (`teams/team-north/digests/2025-10-05-north-sunday.md`). Thea Ramaswell opened it on 4 Oct 2025 because drivers on the 04:00 shift at Eau Claire, Dock Doors 14–18, weren't getting their SMS bay assignments from the gatehouse kiosk. Support fixed it that evening, and Thea confirmed on 5 Oct that the shift got through the gate without help.\n2. **#4419** is in \"Moss: North cheat sheet (undated)\" (`teams/team-north/digests/north-account-cheatsheet.md`). Thea logged it because the gatehouse barcode scanners couldn't read trailer tags at Door 14 on third shift. It was escalated to tier-2 product support for scanner firmware testing. The note has no date and doesn't say whether it was fixed.\n\n**Left out on purpose:**\n- **Not QFL tickets:** #4409, #4412 and FR-882 in Moss's Central handoffs note are for Marrow accounts on the Central team.\n- **No ticket numbers:** Moss's 14 Sep 2025 North pipeline digest and the 23 Mar 2026 renewal check-in both mention QFL, but neither gives a ticket number.\n- **Different company:** Quarendon Freightways (spelled with one \"r\") isn't a customer. Moss's cheat sheet warns not to mix the two up.\n\nThe two QFL tickets both involve Door 14, but they look like separate issues with different number formats. I told Hollis this list only covers Moss's notes, so QFL may have other tickets. All six of Moss's notes are public files. I didn't use the QFL incident channel, because Hollis isn't a member, and nothing needed approval."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DHARNES0001","ts":"1791987000.000125"}}
